WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,360
If you don't go away, you will all die today.

2
00:00:07,520 --> 00:00:09,480
If you don't leave yet, wait until they call people back.

3
00:00:09,480 --> 00:00:10,600
Go, go quickly

4
00:00:12,740 --> 00:00:13,660
Just be afraid

5
00:00:14,060 --> 00:00:16,020
At least you won’t make any random decisions about me in the future.

6
00:00:16,020 --> 00:00:17,500
Why are you alone? Where are they?

7
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:21,260
Did you find anything? Whatever happens outside is behind you.

8
00:00:23,340 --> 00:00:25,300
Captain Zhang, this trip went well, right?

9
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:33,740
Go home first. We can’t tell you everything later.

10
00:00:38,690 --> 00:00:40,210
Didn't you just have trouble getting up?

11
00:00:46,640 --> 00:00:48,480
What is mom secretly drinking?

12
00:00:48,880 --> 00:00:51,610
New soda you want to try
